<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Predicate on 오깅중</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/tags/predicate/</link><description>Recent content in Predicate on 오깅중</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 15:42:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://jun7680.github.io/tags/predicate/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>SwiftData #Predicate에서 enum 비교가 0건을 반환하는 이유</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swiftdata-predicate-enum-silent-zero/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 15:42:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swiftdata-predicate-enum-silent-zero/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;SwiftData 마이그 중에 디버깅 제일 빡셌던 게 &amp;ldquo;에러는 안 나는데 결과가 빈&amp;rdquo; 케이스였다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;scope&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ItemScopeType&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;inbox&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;descriptor&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;FetchDescriptor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;ItemEntity2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;predicate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;#&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Predicate&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;scope&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;scope&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;results&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;try&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fetch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;descriptor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// results.count == 0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;DB엔 분명히 &lt;code&gt;scope = .inbox&lt;/code&gt;인 row가 100건 들어있다. 근데 predicate는 0건 반환. throw도 없고, 로그도 없음.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Realm에서 SwiftData로: 42개 모델을 옮기는 전략과 함정 (Part 2 — Primary Key 함정 3가지)</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/p/realm-to-swiftdata-migration-part-2-primary-key-traps/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 11:00:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://jun7680.github.io/p/realm-to-swiftdata-migration-part-2-primary-key-traps/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TL;DR&lt;/strong&gt; — SwiftData &lt;code&gt;@Attribute(.unique)&lt;/code&gt; Primary Key를 쓰다 silent로 무너지는 3가지를 만났다. ① &lt;code&gt;.invalidInt&lt;/code&gt; 같은 sentinel을 PK 기본값으로 두면 row 충돌이 난다. ② &lt;code&gt;String.hashValue&lt;/code&gt;는 프로세스 재시작마다 시드가 랜덤이라 PK가 안 맞는다. ③ &lt;code&gt;#Predicate&lt;/code&gt; 안에서 enum 비교는 silent fail 한다. &lt;strong&gt;결정적 해시(Boost &lt;code&gt;hash_combine&lt;/code&gt; 포팅) + rawValue 컬럼 분리 + lookup-then-upsert&lt;/strong&gt;로 막았다. 총 6편 시리즈의 &lt;strong&gt;2편(Primary Key 함정 편)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>